              · {formatDuracao(tempoDecorrido)}
            </span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div className="flex flex-col gap-1.5 flex-shrink-0">
          <div className="flex items-center justify-center gap-1 px-2 py-1 bg-[#F4F4F5] rounded-lg">
